This is the turning point of Sarga 188.

Up to now Maharṣi Vasiṣṭha has explained who the jīva is and what the Ātivāhika body is. Now he expands the vision dramatically.

This section reveals how the entire cosmos arises, abides, and dissolves within Consciousness itself.

I would therefore give this part a more majestic title.

